// Tall wall d uses selector lane 2*d bit 0; wall scheme/frame uses lane 2*d+1.
// Lines also read preceding selector lane's low bit as color bit 2.
// Piece y stores bits 0..13; foreground/offscreen preserve bits 15/14.
// Dialogue text offsets are 1-based byte offsets in textPool; zero means absent.
