            ],
            textPool: "Hello.\u0000Goodbye.\u0000Wasn't the door locked?\u0000#4Sorry...\u0000~4No problem.  Good thing you came along anyway.  I thought that I was going to scoop out my eyeballs with a spoon, and make some nice Christmas ornaments and show them to all my friends... ^1But thank goodness you came along!\u0000#0Uh...\u0000~0Oh, I'm sorry, my name's Seth.  This is my room.  It's a bit small, but do you like it?\u0000#1Do you know the passcode to open the door?\u0000~1Yes.  Yes I do...\u0000#2Do you think you could tell it to me?\u0000~2Oh sure...well, actually I'm not supposed to, but I guess I could. ^1Huh.  Wait.  It starts with a P.   No, wait:  it's Ostrich.\u0000#3Thanks.  Thanks a lot.\u0000~3Hey, anytime.  Wanna go get dinner now?\u0000",
